<main class="shell gift-layout">
  <div class="gift-preview-wrap reveal"><div class="gift-preview" data-design="garden" aria-label="Gift card preview"><div class="gift-preview-brand">Ode To Odd</div><div class="gift-preview-message">For something beautifully, entirely your own.</div><div class="gift-preview-amount">₹ 5,000</div></div></div>
  <div class="gift-form reveal"><header><p class="eyebrow">A considered gesture</p><h1 class="display">The Gift of <em>Choice</em></h1><p class="muted">A digital note for a future heirloom, delivered on the day you choose.</p></header><div class="field"><label>Choose a value</label><div class="amount-options"><a class="option-button is-active" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}/gift-card">5,000</a><a class="option-button" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}/gift-card">10,000</a><a class="option-button" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}/gift-card">25,000</a><a class="option-button" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}/gift-card">50,000</a></div></div><p class="form-note">Create a Shopify gift card product named “Gift Card” to let this page sell live gift cards with Shopify checkout.</p><a class="button-solid" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Shop giftable pieces</a></div>
</main>
<section class="section gift-story" aria-labelledby="giftStoryTitle"><div class="shell section-heading reveal"><div><p class="eyebrow">A keepsake, considered</p><h2 class="display" id="giftStoryTitle">Front, back, and <em>the reveal</em></h2></div><p>The chosen design carries through the card, personal note, and presentation.</p></div><div class="shell gift-gallery"><figure class="gift-gallery-figure reveal"><div class="gift-gallery-card gift-gallery-front"><span>Ode To Odd</span><strong>₹ 5,000</strong></div></figure><figure class="gift-gallery-figure reveal"><div class="gift-gallery-card gift-gallery-back"><span>For</span><strong>Someone special</strong><p>For something beautifully, entirely your own.</p></div></figure><figure class="gift-gallery-figure reveal"><div class="gift-envelope"><div class="gift-envelope-flap"></div><span>With love, from Ode to Odd</span></div></figure></div></section>
{% schema %}{"name":"Gift card page"}{% endschema %}
